Open the sidemenu
Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
Click the "Orders" charttab
Click the "Orders-List Editor" charttab subtab
Click the "Orders-List Editor" link
Click the "Legacy Orders List Editor" link
Begin "Add a New Order"
	Click the "Add An Order" link
	Type "PROC" in the "Type" input
	Type "Procedure" in the 1st "Description" input
	Select "Before Type" from the "Where?" dropdown
	Select "Protocols" from the "Relative to..." dropdown
	Type "Bleeding by Leeches" in the "Order Name" field
	Type "BLEED" in the "Order Code" input
	Type "Best done by Theodoric of York, Medieval Barber" in the "Provider Guideline" field
	Click the "Save" button
	Verify exists "Order List Entry Added" text
Begin "Search for New Order"
	Type "Bleed" in the 1st input
	Click the "Search" button
	Verify exists "Bleeding by Leeches" text
Begin "Edit the New Order"
	Click the "Edit" listview link
	Type "OU812" in the "Order Billing Code" input
	Click the "Save" button
Begin "Verify changes"
	Verify exists "OU812" text

